  "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en-CA\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Orders / Ordres — Pressroom</title>\n  <style>\n    @page { size: Letter portrait; }\n    :root { color: #182d3f; font-family: 'Noto Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; }\n    body { margin: 0; }\n    h1 { font-size: 25pt; margin: 5mm 0 2mm; }\n    h2 { font-size: 14pt; margin: 7mm 0 3mm; }\n    p { line-height: 1.55; }\n    .eyebrow { color: #526878; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: 8pt; }\n    .rule { border-top: 3px solid #225d76; padding-top: 4mm; }\n    .note { background: #eef5f6; border-left: 3px solid #3f7d8e; padding: 4mm; }\n    .mark { float: right; width: 14mm; height: 14mm; }\n    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 9pt; }\n    th { background: #225d76; color: white; text-align: left; padding: 3mm; }\n    td { padding: 3mm; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfdae0; }\n    tr { break-inside: avoid; }\n    .number { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }\n    .second-language { break-before: page; }\n    @media screen { body { background: #faf7ef; } }\n    @media print { body { background: white; } }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"english-title\">\n    <svg class=\"mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sample document mark\"><rect width=\"48\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#225d76\"/><path d=\"M12 13h24v4H12zm0 9h24v4H12zm0 9h16v4H12z\" fill=\"white\"/></svg>\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Pressroom · Demonstration document</p>\n    <h1 id=\"english-title\">Orders</h1>\n    <p class=\"rule\"><strong>Unit:</strong> Sample support team<br><strong>Period:</strong> October 2026<br><strong>Reference:</strong> PR-0001</p>\n    <h2>Requested items</h2>\n    <table>\n      <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Description</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"number\">Quantity</th><th scope=\"col\">Destination</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Letter paper, recycled</td><td class=\"number\">12</td><td>Operations office</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Document folders, blue</td><td class=\"number\">48</td><td>Administration</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Reusable labels</td><td class=\"number\">24</td><td>Reception</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <h2>Instructions</h2>\n    <p>Deliver during office hours. Keep the order reference with the shipment. This sample contains no live operational information.</p>\n    <p class=\"note\"><strong>Rendering check:</strong> This document uses the packaged Noto Sans font in regular, <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, and <strong><em>bold italic</em></strong>. Its second page checks French text and an explicit page break.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"second-language\" lang=\"fr-CA\" aria-labelledby=\"french-title\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Pressroom · Document de démonstration</p>\n    <h1 id=\"french-title\">Ordres</h1>\n    <p class=\"rule\"><strong>Unité :</strong> Équipe de soutien fictive<br><strong>Période :</strong> Octobre 2026<br><strong>Référence :</strong> PR-0001</p>\n    <h2>Articles demandés</h2>\n    <table>\n      <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Description</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"number\">Quantité</th><th scope=\"col\">Destination</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Papier recyclé, format lettre</td><td class=\"number\">12</td><td>Bureau des opérations</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Chemises bleues</td><td class=\"number\">48</td><td>Administration</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Étiquettes réutilisables</td><td class=\"number\">24</td><td>Réception</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <h2>Consignes</h2>\n    <p>Livrer pendant les heures de bureau. Joindre la référence de commande à l'envoi. Cet exemple ne contient aucune information opérationnelle réelle.</p>\n    <p class=\"note\"><strong>Vérification typographique :</strong> élève, Noël, façade, cœur, œuvre, où, à bientôt — 25 °C. <em>Les accents, les ligatures et la ponctuation doivent rester lisibles.</em></p>\n  </section>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
